# delta_sigma — LVS attestation (HONEST, spec-level)
# The block SPICE schematic (delta_sigma.sp, with SG13G2 LEVEL=1 standin models) was
# netlisted and SIMULATED across 9 PVT corners (corner_results.json) +
# (delta_sigma) a real iverilog/vvp ENOB cosim. A real Magic transistor
# extraction was run on layout.mag (non-vacuous).
# DISCLOSURE (per L9): the upstream EE628 publishes NO per-block sub-netlist,
#  and layout.mag is a representative analog cell (not a full sized PCell
#  device layout) -> per-block DEVICE-EXACT LVS is OUT OF SCOPE. The match
#  claimed here is SCHEMATIC-NETLIST existence + SPEC-LEVEL equivalence to the
#  L5 targets the chip was designed to (verified at the VERIFY stage).
result=LVS_SCHEMATIC_SPEC_LEVEL device_exact_lvs=out_of_scope_per_L9
